<title>FRANCE: Bouygues H1 net attrib loss 146 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bouygues H1 net attrib loss 146 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable		     loss  146  vs     profit 97</p>
<p>Net attributable by sector</p>
<p>			 -- roadbuilding  loss   415  vs	loss 207</p>
<p>			 -- telecoms	loss    60  vs		--</p>
<p>    Operating			    profit  155  vs  profit 1,005</p>
<p>    Exceptional			   gain   267  vs    gain    61</p>
<p>    Financial expense			    174  vs	     233</p>
<p>    Turnover				    34,183  vs	  34,190</p>
<p>NOTE - Bouygues issued its half-year results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the first-half net attributable loss was due mainly to big losses in its seasonally hit roadbuilding business and a 60 million franc loss linked to the launch of its telecoms activities. Turnover including its SAUR unit was 38,107 million francs versus 38,486 million.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
